ral shell and must not be treated as proof. The candidate proof route is mathematically expandable, but completion requires substantial NL0 restructuring into independently exported content-bridge and dimension-bound nodes, full object definitions, source applications, and complete locally scoped derivations; no substantive mathematical gap has been established.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"Task inputs problem.md, frozen-target.md, source-context.md, measure-bridge.json, completed-proof.json, audit-findings.json, prior-candidate.json; Yui references read in this stage.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Reviewed the completed proof and measure-bridge derivations, including the positive-diameter upper-cover repair, the positive-exponent slicing and restricted-interval ENNReal lintegral derivation, and the nonempty zero-dimension projection branch. Probed M001 hausdorffMeasure_of_lt_dimH, M002 MeasureTheory.lintegral_tsum, M003 hausdorffMeasure_of_dimH_lt, M004 LipschitzWith.dimH_image_le, and M005 Real.dimH_of_nonempty_interior. A mistaken probe of Measure.hausdorffMeasure_apply failed because it is not a proved theorem declaration; this formula is a definition/source fact and cannot be retained as M. No acceptance or Audit A pass is claimed.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report exact status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP or SUSPECTED_GAP stops for an actual unsupported mathematical implication; give its premises, conclusion and mathematical grounds. SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT stops for a real source-access/original-input obstacle. Ordinary unfinished drafting, source registration or format work must use TASK_INCOMPLETE: this records progress without ending the stage; continue the actual work. Difficulty or artifact incompletion alone is not a mathematical gap.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"obstacle_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["obstacle_json"],"additi